## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-02. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Malefic Gun, Wind of Nature
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Malefic Roar over Malefic Gun when Use when the enemy front line stacks Physical Defense and you can already hit safely.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic burst or mixed dive where physical immunity will not stop the first engage.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Gun when Use when a healer, shield support, or high-extra-HP fighter is keeping the first target alive.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Default gold lane setup that keeps Karrie's trinity core intact, then buys range or physical immunity based on who can reach her.

### Front-to-Back Anti-Tank (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Malefic Roar when Use if a physical assassin or fighter can bypass your tank before you finish the first target.; Dominance Ice over Sea Halberd when Use only in forced close-range fights against lifesteal cores, so Lifebane's aura suppresses their sustain. Swaps Sea Halberd, not Malefic Roar: two Lifebanes do not stack, and Lightwheel Mark ignores defense but her autos need penetration.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Front-to-back setup for tank-heavy drafts where Karrie is allowed to stand behind peel and keep hitting the nearest durable target.

### Safe Late Game (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Rose Gold Meteor, Immortality
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use against physical burst if the main threat is a basic-attack assassin or marksman.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against one-shot magic engage that decides fights before Immortality can matter.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use against repeated magic damage that chips you through every extended front-to-back fight.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

Defensive setup for CC-heavy or burst-heavy games where surviving the first lockout matters more than maximizing the sixth damage slot.

